  "what": "The landing decision node (omnimarket#3045, the S1 to S20 tested decide_landing) and the red rules of the lifecycle triage node (node_pr_lifecycle_triage_compute: classify_red and its siblings, plan S3) the landing controller runs. Includes the shared cause signature (OMN-20746) the node imports, the head-check models the triage node re-exports, and the bus path's claim identities (models/ci_red_triage.py, OMN-20747) the controller's tests compare against. The installer extracts exactly these paths at this commit and builds the decision venv (pydantic and pyyaml; the installer installs pydantic only until the installer change of the OMN-24297 contract's AC4 lands) on the brew interpreter; G-ACT receipts must name this commit. The red-CI triage contract (node_pr_lifecycle_orchestrator/contract.yaml, OMN-20748) is pinned too: its ci_red_triage.act turns the runner class on, and the controller leaves exactly that class to the bus. The remote-lane runner's placement and closing nodes (node_remote_lane_compute, node_remote_lane_close_compute, OMN-20669) ride along at the same commit: the remote-lane tests run their handlers in process through tests/remote_lane_node_double.py, from the paths CI already extracts for this pin. The placement handler imports the engine-ladder models (models/model_engine_experiment.py, omnimarket#4382), so that file is pinned with it. The PR-state schema (events/pr_state.py, omnimarket#3682) is pinned alone, without events/__init__.py: models/ci_red_triage.py imports it, and the events package's own __init__ imports omnibase_core, which the pydantic-only venv lacks. OMN-24297: repinned to 50ad28a507 (the stale_fleet red class of omnimarket#5931 and the package bind node, omnimarket#6106). The decision runtime now holds pydantic and pyyaml (the \"pyyaml\" key; the decision handler reads packaged contract.yaml sections), and the bridge binds the decision node's package without its __init__, which binds the J8 join and needs omnibase_core and omnibase_infra, through the pinned node_package_bind_effect (its directory is pinned whole). The added package files are the import closure of the decision handler and the triage rule handlers at that commit, with the contract.yaml of the lane-model-policy and lab-placement nodes the decision reads."
}
